SECTION | KEY | VALUE
----------------------------------------
# keybinds.pdl - gta-hq INT keys. SAME codes as @.apps/pet-trainer/keybinds.pdl (and piececraft-hq): in interact mode the khtpm window appends "<code> <ms>" lines to state/interact_relay.txt;
# arrows arrive as 1000 left, 1001 right, 1002 up, 1003 down (NOT the 200-203 band of the agent relay file), Esc and Enter go to state/keyboard/history.txt.
KEY | arrow_left  | 1000
KEY | arrow_right | 1001
KEY | arrow_up    | 1002
KEY | arrow_down  | 1003
KEY | control_switch | 9      # Tab: INT drives the selected pet <-> the player
KEY | render_mode_toggle | 112 # 'p'  toggle 2D <-> 3D (was 0; D152)
KEY | pov_mode_1 | 121 # 'y'  first person (was 1; D152)
KEY | pov_mode_2 | 117 # 'u'  third person (was 2; D152)
KEY | pov_mode_3 | 105 # 'i'  free roam (was 3; D152)
KEY | pov_mode_4 | 111 # 'o'  bird eye (was 4; D152)
KEY | escape | 27
